From: Ian Blenke <ian@blenke.com>
Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 18:50:14 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 08545/11362] test: fix 3 stale ARC tests found during Gap 3's
 regression sweep

All three are stale_test, not production regressions -- root-caused via an
adversarially-verified investigation workflow (one agent per test, isolated
worktrees, each diagnosis independently re-checked by a second agent that
empirically applied the proposed fix before signing off).

1. test_experiment_5727_arc_generalization_live_oracle_gap_v511.py::
   test_req_arc_wmte_5727_e3_proposer_port_env_override -- same root cause as
   the already-filed test_arc_submitted_agent_parity.py pair: the live
   ARC_LIVE_GENERATOR_REPO_SUBSTR constant was repinned to the qat variant by
   commit 6526b472a8 (2026-07-31, VRAM-driven, backed by a 20-game head-to-head
   showing qat/Q4_K_M are statistically indistinguishable on quality). Fixed
   the assertion and a second stale claim in the same comment (the "no MTP
   heads" premise, already corrected elsewhere in the codebase). A repo-wide
   sweep for the same assertion pattern found no further undiscovered stale
   sites; the test_arc_submitted_agent_parity.py pair remains open (same fix
   applies, not touched in this commit).

2. test_experiment_4605_live_integration_scored_agent.py::
   test_req_capstone_4605_submitted_policy_wires_safe_live_stack -- commit
   ca8e078ccb (2026-07-25, Exp5904/5927) wrapped
   load_cross_game_discriminative_router's return value inside an
   OnlineClickTargetRouter, so a stub swapped in at the inner loader only ever
   reaches .base of the wrapper, never the object the test compared against.
   Fixed by monkeypatching load_online_click_target_router instead -- the
   function _load_submitted_candidate_router actually calls today.

3. test_experiment_4821_structural_energy_s3_generation_lift.py::
   test_scenario_arc_wmte_4821_live_e3_passes_goal_energy_to_plan -- two
   deliberate interface changes to _induce_and_plan's plain-path calling
   contract postdate this test's authoring commit: d9de98aedd (2026-07-27,
   added hud_mask= + change_gate_decision(), reading VerifyResult fields the
   hand-rolled fake lacked) and c48b6a853d (2026-07-15, added an unconditional
   diagnostics= kwarg). The resulting exception was silently swallowed by
   _induce_and_plan's own outer except, so plan_in_model was never reached and
   the reported IndexError followed from an empty captured list. The
   adversarial verify pass caught that the first proposed fix omitted three
   VerifyResult fields read before change_gate_decision runs; the corrected,
   empirically re-verified fix is what's committed here.

All three fixes are test-only -- no production code changed. Verified: the 3
target node ids pass, all 3 files' full suites (17 tests) pass, ruff/
ruff-format/mypy clean on the edited regions (one pre-existing, unrelated mypy
error at test_experiment_5727...py:413 confirmed outside this commit's diff).

ops/known-issues.md's 2026-08-08 addendum (findings 4-6) is marked RESOLVED
with the root causes and fix summary, per the addendum's own falsifiable gate.

